WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.860
- All right. It's always
nice to end the hour

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:04.140
with something that could
possibly make you feel good.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.315
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.315 --> 00:00:08.160
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.010
It is no secret that
nurses do angels' work.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.470
We all know that, especially
by now, they take care of us

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.730
physically and often, emotionally as well.

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:19.710
But one Atlanta nurse has gone
above and beyond even that.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.240
When her patient passed away,

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.751
she decided to adopt the woman's dog.

00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:25.740
It's been a match made in heaven

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.250
and we have this super kind
frontline worker dialed in now,

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.850
with her newest pup,
Jacks, watching on WSB-TV.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:34.650
What's up, Kim? How're you doing?

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.861
- Hi, Kelly.
(applause)

00:00:36.861 --> 00:00:39.600
- Hi. Oh, well, tell us more about

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.614
how Jacks came into your life.

00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:46.614
- So, I actually took care of
his former owner in the ICU.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.380
I got to know her family
when they flew in town,

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.840
and they were extremely sweet.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.430
They told me the dog had
unfortunately been in the pound

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.680
for about a week because
they did not live local.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.930
And when she got sick,
that's where he was taken.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.370
So as soon as I found that out,

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:05.580
I told them that I would go pick him up

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.010
without even knowing
what kind of dog he was.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.590
And when I got there, I saw him,

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:14.193
and I instantly fell in love
and he's been mine ever since.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.020
- I love this story.

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.320
So how is Jacks adapting to his new life?

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.670
- He's doing great.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.340
Like, he fits right into my life.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:25.680
He's spunky and he's fun.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.650
My other dog, Hailey,
absolutely adores him

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.483
most of the time.

00:01:29.483 --> 00:01:32.100
Sometimes he's a little bit
much, but he's a lot of fun.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.376
He loves to travel with me.

00:01:33.376 --> 00:01:34.980
- Aw, that's awesome.

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.010
I love dogs. Thank you so much, Kim.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.360
Jacks is super cute.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.040
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.050
Thank you as well for being a nurse.

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.720
Thank you so much for that.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.560
But that's not all.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:48.480
Our season-long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.210
makers of G2, the go-to pen
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.670
want to honor truly unstoppable people,

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.230
and just remarkable people just like you.

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:56.430
So they're gonna be writing you a check

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.888
for a thousand dollars. How's that sound?

00:01:57.888 --> 00:02:00.321
(applause)
- Oh my goodness.

00:02:00.321 --> 00:02:01.293
Thank you so much.

00:02:01.293 --> 00:02:03.152
I feel incredibly blessed.

00:02:03.152 --> 00:02:05.387
Thank you so much. That's insane.

00:02:05.387 --> 00:02:08.160
I, I feel so lucky. Thank you.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:10.613
- Well, it's, we can't do
anything to possibly repay

00:02:10.613 --> 00:02:12.930
like, the sacrifice you
nurses have made for us

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:15.490
you doctors, everybody,
and, and care like y'all.

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:18.570
We, I've always appreciated it,
but now we get it even more.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.580
So thank you so much for what you do,

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:23.070
and thank you to all our guests today,

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:26.220
the incomparable and
amazing Cher and Renée Rapp.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.860
From my house to yours, y'all,
I hope you have a great day.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:30.960
And if it's not, well try and change that.

